- **/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/rest/function/owner/AddressNormalizer.java** — `static String normalize(String raw)`: trim, collapse whitespace, upper-case, expand whole-word abbreviations (`ST`→`STREET`, `RD`→`ROAD`, `AVE`→`AVENUE`). Null/blank → `""`. Package-private final class.
- **/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/rest/function/owner/ValidateOwner.java** — runs first on both POST and PUT; mutates the request: normalizes address, requires firstName/lastName/address/city/telephone, normalizes telephone to E.164 (else `InvalidTelephoneException`), lower-cases/validates optional email (else `InvalidEmailException`), publishes validated `OwnerFieldsDto` via `Out<OwnerFieldsDto>`.

---

## 2. Owner entity

### /home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/model/Owner.java
