- `address` `@NotEmpty` (col `address`)
- `city` `@NotEmpty` (col `city`)
- `telephone` `@NotEmpty @Pattern("^\\+[0-9]{8,15}$")` (col `telephone`)
- `email` (col `email`, no constraint)
- `registrationDate` `LocalDate` (col `registration_date`)
- `customerCode` (col `customer_code`)
- `householdId` (col `household_id`)
- `namesakeCount` `Integer` (col `namesake_count`)
- `membershipNumber` (col `membership_number`)
- `pets` `Set<Pet>`

